{"ref":"BDB, מַתִּתְיָ֫הוּ","hw":"מַתִּתְיָ֫הוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַתִּתְיָ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַתִּתְיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>cf. Gray<sup>Prop. N. 294, No. 81</sup><strong>)</strong>;—𝔊 Ματταθιας, etc.;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a Levitical musician, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַתִּתְיָ֫הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.18\">1 Ch 15:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.3\">25:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.21\">21</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">מַתִּתְיָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.5\">16:5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">מַתִּתְיָה</span>, Levitical name <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.31\">1 Ch 9:31</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span>, attendant of Ezra (also Levite?) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.4\">Ne 8:4</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  one of those who took strange wives <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:43\" href=\"/Ezra.10.43\">Ezr 10:43</a>.","next":"BDB, מֵתַּתָּה","prev":"BDB, מַתְּנַי²"}